":758,"line_no":107863,"gurmukhi":"ਯਾ ਮੈ ਕਛੂ ਭੇਦ ਨਹੀ ਮਾਨੋ ॥੭੮੬॥","translit_en":"yaa mai kachhoo bhedh nahee maano ||786||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"Saying firstly “Dharaa-raatani”, then speak “Jaa-char-nayak” and knowing all the names of Tupak, do not consider any discrimination in it.786."},"pu":{"ss":"ਇਸ ਵਿਚ ਰਤਾ ਜਿੰਨਾ ਫਰਕ ਨਾ ਮਨੋ ॥੭੮੬॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":9521,"next":9523}}